<title>JAPAN: Tsurumi Mfg - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tsurumi Mfg - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.66		vs	   13.26</p>
<p> Operating	  911    million	  vs	  777    million</p>
<p> Current		1.20		vs	    1.24</p>
